<http://data.silknow.org/object/cd42b908-8301-3a69-974a-dfddb36ace94/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Cover, linen embroidered with silk in atma, double running in a line, close herringbone and couched lines. \nThere is an inset border formed by a solid blue line with outward facing red or blue trefoil leaves at intervals. At each corner of the field is part of a blue blossom. Down the centre of the field is a row of circular blue blossoms to either side of which is a fine meander formed by sections of green stem, green leaves and red tulips."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/cd42b908-8301-3a69-974a-dfddb36ace94> .

